BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FFXIV] Announcing the Fan Festival Group Pose Screenshot Campaign
 !
DTSTART:20261023T170000Z
DTEND:20261106T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T115355Z
UID:e8759e8907e4@mmo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:FFXIV Fan Festival 2026 in Tokyo is almost here! To celebrate
 \, we'll be hosting a group pose screenshot campaign starting Friday\, Oct
 ober 23!\n\nDecorate a screenshot using the limited-time frames and sticke
 rs themed after the Fan Festival. Post it on social media and share it thr
 ough our entry submission page for a chance to win one of the listed in-ga
 me prizes below.\n\n Read the official rules for full terms and conditions
  to find out how you can enter and submit your entry.
URL:https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/378ff35cd6769fc
 2d8bb0c3dd1003f7b90c9811a
END:VEVENT
